WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.770
Fight for your justice,
show your courage.

00:06.770 --> 00:10.370
Right! Grasp truth in these hands.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.780
Fight for your justice, I want you

00:13.780 --> 00:21.200
as you fight through
with your head held up high.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.930
Rather than polishing diamonds

00:43.040 --> 00:46.970
give me a glistening future.

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Even if nothing's there, get up.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.350
It's important to turn on the switch.

00:57.450 --> 01:00.220
Something new that I don't want to yield.

01:00.220 --> 01:04.750
Seeking it is justice!

01:06.360 --> 01:09.930
Fight for your justice,
be serious about it.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.540
Right! Face reality head on.

01:13.540 --> 01:16.940
Fight for your justice,
I love how you

01:16.940 --> 01:27.340
never give up even if
the current is against you.

01:45.600 --> 01:48.500
Jeez, you're space's worst money-waster.

01:48.500 --> 01:49.600
Out of bullets?

01:49.600 --> 01:50.870
I'll make it cheap!

01:50.870 --> 01:53.400
Hmph, you know I need them.

01:59.850 --> 02:01.410
What is that?

02:02.950 --> 02:06.350
Maintain position!
Section leaders, damage report!

02:06.350 --> 02:09.120
Report or not, I can't steer at all!

02:09.120 --> 02:12.560
The Paksis can't be controlled!
It's completely frozen!

02:12.560 --> 02:13.930
What a situation!

02:13.930 --> 02:15.230
No doubt about it.

02:15.230 --> 02:20.030
Looks like you guys
seriously pissed off Earth.

02:20.030 --> 02:22.070
What is that red thing?

02:22.070 --> 02:23.440
Calm down, Valore.

02:23.440 --> 02:25.570
Leave the monster
to Meia and the others.

02:25.570 --> 02:28.080
We should go guard the Nirvana.

02:28.080 --> 02:29.740
R-Roger!

02:32.310 --> 02:34.620
You sure gave a nasty, little hello.

02:34.620 --> 02:37.520
Why's all the Paksis from Earth red?

02:37.520 --> 02:42.020
The Paksis is a being that changes
according to the hearts that touch it.

02:42.020 --> 02:46.330
Red is an uncertain color.
A closed heart, unaccepting.

02:46.330 --> 02:47.800
A closed heart...

02:47.800 --> 02:50.330
Unaccepting?

02:50.330 --> 02:53.770
Why? Why?

03:10.150 --> 03:11.420
What are you doing?

03:11.420 --> 03:12.650
We're in battle.

03:12.650 --> 03:14.920
That's why I'm looking.

03:14.920 --> 03:19.160
For this girl, time passes
differently than it does for us.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.560
See, look at her face.

03:21.560 --> 03:24.050
Are you saying the next
generation has already begun?

03:28.070 --> 03:30.370
If you don't want to accept us...

03:32.670 --> 03:35.400
I'll make you accept
us whether you like it or not!

03:50.730 --> 03:52.560
Get away from me!

03:52.560 --> 03:54.220
Not yet!

04:00.440 --> 04:03.270
Damn you!

04:06.040 --> 04:07.700
Mr. Alien!

04:11.380 --> 04:12.350
Everyone...

04:12.350 --> 04:14.680
Dreads can't break that shield.

04:14.680 --> 04:16.320
What should we do?

04:16.320 --> 04:18.990
It seems we have
to leave it to those kids.

04:18.990 --> 04:20.620
- Captain.
- Barnette.

04:20.620 --> 04:24.160
You and Valore take
command of the Dread team.

04:24.160 --> 04:26.560
There are still
plenty of enemies left.

04:26.560 --> 04:28.220
- Roger!
- Roger!

04:30.670 --> 04:32.700
What is this pressure?

04:32.700 --> 04:35.440
Is this also the power of the Paksis?

04:35.440 --> 04:38.240
Mr. Alien... Answer me!

04:38.240 --> 04:39.900
Mr. Alien!

04:43.880 --> 04:45.540
O-Ow...

04:57.930 --> 04:59.980
You're an Earthling?

05:03.030 --> 05:07.400
- Damn you...
- It's useless.

05:07.400 --> 05:09.170
Mr. Alien!

05:09.170 --> 05:11.310
You guys...

05:11.310 --> 05:13.370
Were you the voice I just heard?

05:13.370 --> 05:16.480
The Paksis is showing
an interest in all of you.

05:16.480 --> 05:20.820
It seems you've gotten strange
powers by getting in synch with it.

05:20.820 --> 05:22.220
This place is...

05:22.220 --> 05:24.590
Are you all right, Mr. Alien?

05:24.590 --> 05:25.890
Somehow...

05:25.890 --> 05:28.660
Now, you incomplete people.

05:28.660 --> 05:30.220
Incomplete?

05:30.220 --> 05:33.390
I'll beat you up for making fun of us!

05:38.900 --> 05:41.600
Zen, leader of Tarak.

05:41.600 --> 05:44.070
Anri, leader of Mejale.

05:44.070 --> 05:46.810
Thanks to you all, Earth is eternal.

05:46.810 --> 05:48.210
Thank you.

05:48.210 --> 05:50.750
What's eternal? He's kidding!

05:50.750 --> 05:54.550
All of you were born thanks to us.

05:54.550 --> 05:57.250
Isn't it proper that you benefit us?

05:57.250 --> 06:00.290
Yet you get in our
way all over the universe.

06:00.290 --> 06:03.860
You've been causing us much trouble.

06:03.860 --> 06:05.260
You all know, right?

06:05.260 --> 06:07.530
Earth will fall at this rate.

06:07.530 --> 06:12.670
That is why we chose
the best method for mankind.

06:12.670 --> 06:14.600
We are Earth's children.

06:14.600 --> 06:17.570
That is why we cannot perish.

06:17.570 --> 06:20.940
Compared to we pitiable
ones forbidden to die

06:20.940 --> 06:23.310
are you not happy you can die?

06:23.310 --> 06:26.800
You can continue to live as part of us.

06:27.920 --> 06:30.450
In a way, he has a point.

06:30.450 --> 06:33.090
Isn't the most
idealistic thing for humans

06:33.090 --> 06:35.290
to die for someone else?

06:35.290 --> 06:39.090
Not everyone can go
so far for another's sake.

06:39.090 --> 06:42.100
But all of you were
born with that destiny.

06:42.100 --> 06:44.560
I think you're happy that way.

06:46.230 --> 06:49.640
Amazing. He talks more than I do.

06:49.640 --> 06:51.000
But he's too horrible.

06:52.640 --> 06:55.310
Is it for Earth?

06:55.310 --> 06:56.640
When you say that...

06:56.640 --> 06:57.750
Yeah...

06:57.750 --> 06:59.280
W-Wait a minute!

06:59.280 --> 07:01.510
Don't be so pessimistic!

07:04.190 --> 07:06.820
G-Guys...

07:06.820 --> 07:09.360
No, that's not it!

07:09.360 --> 07:12.490
What you're doing is plain murder!

07:12.490 --> 07:16.130
You're just taking away
everyone's right to live free!

07:16.130 --> 07:19.370
Say that it's very practical, miss.

07:19.370 --> 07:22.300
We just cut out the excess.

07:23.910 --> 07:27.070
Everyone hates failure
and hard times, right?

07:27.070 --> 07:31.010
But using our method,
the human race won't perish.

07:31.010 --> 07:32.580
You understand, right?

07:32.580 --> 07:35.750
No, no, no!

07:35.750 --> 07:39.020
I'm dumb and a klutz...

07:39.020 --> 07:42.890
But the way I care about
others is stronger than anything!

07:42.890 --> 07:48.100
I'll happily give my life,
my body to people I care about!

07:48.100 --> 07:52.370
But I go that far because
of how I feel about them!

07:52.370 --> 07:56.700
It's definitely different from
forcefully taking it away like you!

07:56.700 --> 07:59.070
Well said, Dita.

07:59.070 --> 08:00.270
Hey, boy.

08:00.270 --> 08:03.440
No matter how powerful you are...
How important you are...

08:03.440 --> 08:06.910
Do you get how that's not
enough to move people's hearts?

08:06.910 --> 08:09.580
There is a finite end to our lives.

08:09.580 --> 08:13.650
We all know that we age,
and our lives will end someday.

08:13.650 --> 08:16.190
That's why we live
each day to the fullest.

08:16.190 --> 08:19.490
That's why we keep going
through trial and error.

08:19.490 --> 08:22.900
But that isn't just for ourselves.

08:22.900 --> 08:26.370
It's so that we create
a path for others to follow!

08:26.370 --> 08:31.010
Cowards clinging to the present
and no longer moving forward

08:31.010 --> 08:34.530
can never see the light
of the future beyond the crest!

08:36.540 --> 08:37.750
Interesting!

08:37.750 --> 08:39.870
These guys really are interesting!

08:41.450 --> 08:44.450
Only the weak believe in the future.

08:44.450 --> 08:48.560
I'm bored of talking to you now.

08:48.560 --> 08:50.850
Irritating, little, old brat!

08:54.160 --> 08:55.820
Mr. Alien!

08:58.030 --> 08:59.200
Geez.

08:59.200 --> 09:01.370
I have to say this is pitiful.

09:01.370 --> 09:04.710
To think that I finally
understand it now...

09:04.710 --> 09:08.780
Though I said something mature
like giving proof that I lived...

09:08.780 --> 09:12.350
I'm still scared at this point.

09:12.350 --> 09:15.920
I'm still trembling from fear of losing.

09:15.920 --> 09:17.750
And now I finally get it.

09:17.750 --> 09:19.990
I need to overcome myself.

09:19.990 --> 09:22.960
Not the enemy in front
of me or their weapons.

09:22.960 --> 09:27.490
It's me, trembling from fear!

09:28.760 --> 09:31.700
You have much to learn.

09:31.700 --> 09:37.040
You sound like you're on top,
but the same goes for you.

09:37.040 --> 09:39.310
You guys are scared, too.

09:39.310 --> 09:43.340
That's why you list stupid
reasons to convince yourselves.

09:43.340 --> 09:45.580
Right? But...

09:45.580 --> 09:48.550
there's a definite
difference between you and me.

09:48.550 --> 09:50.650
You know what that is?

09:50.650 --> 09:52.150
It's that...

09:52.150 --> 09:55.460
I have lots of friends!

09:55.460 --> 09:59.490
I have people who believe in me,
even if I'm like this.

09:59.490 --> 10:03.760
People who're like family that
scold me when I do something wrong!

10:03.760 --> 10:05.370
But you're alone.

10:05.370 --> 10:10.740
I'm not scared of words from
a wimp who can't open his heart.

10:10.740 --> 10:14.210
When I finally overcome myself...

10:14.210 --> 10:16.470
beating you will be a piece of cake!

10:19.580 --> 10:21.380
I...

10:21.380 --> 10:24.940
hate you.

10:29.820 --> 10:31.490
Mr. Alien!

10:34.100 --> 10:36.530
You should...

10:36.530 --> 10:38.160
go away!

10:48.640 --> 10:50.130
Mr. Alien!

10:51.710 --> 10:53.080
Damn you...

10:55.720 --> 10:57.120
Are you running?

10:57.120 --> 10:58.980
Everyone should die!

11:02.090 --> 11:03.080
That's...

11:05.830 --> 11:07.690
This isn't good...

11:13.270 --> 11:16.630
I won't let you do whatever you want!

11:18.670 --> 11:20.330
Mr. Alien!

11:22.140 --> 11:23.940
O-Oh no!

11:23.940 --> 11:25.450
Captain!

11:25.450 --> 11:30.280
We had this same response when
we were thrown into the other sector!

11:30.280 --> 11:31.590
What?

11:31.590 --> 11:35.590
The Paksis' survival instinct
created a wormhole that time.

11:35.590 --> 11:37.560
I thought that was the case.

11:37.560 --> 11:40.460
That's not an act to get out of danger!

11:40.460 --> 11:45.370
It's using the wormhole's
energy to twist time and space!

11:45.370 --> 11:46.670
What does that mean?

11:46.670 --> 11:51.270
They're trying to blow
away everything in this sector!

11:51.270 --> 11:52.740
There's nowhere to run!

11:52.740 --> 11:57.450
They sure made an unbelievable
monster of the Paksis...

11:57.450 --> 11:59.680
Hibiki!

11:59.680 --> 12:01.110
That shield again!

12:03.780 --> 12:05.750
I won't let you do it...

12:09.390 --> 12:11.790
In the end, it was a half-assed life...

12:11.790 --> 12:15.060
But I finally get it, Gramps.

12:15.060 --> 12:17.800
Even if my life ends right here...

12:17.800 --> 12:23.540
as long as they're all alive,
I'll keep living on in their hearts.

12:23.540 --> 12:26.110
Isn't that right, partner?

12:26.110 --> 12:28.100
That's not the way it should be!

12:29.410 --> 12:30.680
Dita, stop it!

12:30.680 --> 12:32.670
Don't come here, idiot!

12:33.680 --> 12:36.850
I finally understand, too.

12:36.850 --> 12:40.590
I'm dumb, so I'm no good
with this complicated world.

12:40.590 --> 12:44.020
But if it's about you,
I understand really well!

12:44.020 --> 12:47.660
Right now, you're risking
your life to protect everyone...

12:47.660 --> 12:50.630
That's why I'm going
to protect you, Mr. Alien.

12:50.630 --> 12:54.140
Because I love you very much!

12:54.140 --> 12:55.100
That's why...

12:55.100 --> 12:57.760
I'm going to protect Hibiki!

12:59.240 --> 13:01.370
Don't come here, Dita!

13:09.350 --> 13:11.950
You idiot, why'd you come?

13:11.950 --> 13:15.820
The two of us will be a stronger
power than just you alone.

13:19.890 --> 13:21.030
Right?

13:21.030 --> 13:24.100
Geez, you're hopelessly dumb.

13:24.100 --> 13:26.670
Not "you." It's "Dita"!

13:26.670 --> 13:28.800
Come on, say it again.

13:28.800 --> 13:31.970
I-Idiot, this isn't the time!

13:31.970 --> 13:33.140
Oh, come on!

13:33.140 --> 13:34.640
You know...

13:34.640 --> 13:37.650
How long are you going
to be lovey-dovey?

13:37.650 --> 13:41.150
Let's close the gate in
one shot with Vandread Pyoro!

13:41.150 --> 13:43.620
Geez, each and every one...

13:47.390 --> 13:49.820
Super Vandread has entered the gate!

13:49.820 --> 13:51.960
It's holding up a shield!

13:51.960 --> 13:53.630
We detect dormant energy

13:53.630 --> 13:56.600
within the spacial
distortion of the expansion!

13:56.600 --> 13:59.620
It's putting a lot of pressure on them!

14:07.340 --> 14:09.000
Damn it!

14:11.280 --> 14:13.450
Stop! Don't overexert yourselves!

14:13.450 --> 14:14.620
Overexerting...

14:14.620 --> 14:17.210
is only for those
with no breathing room!

14:25.860 --> 14:27.760
- Not good.
- Jura!

14:27.760 --> 14:30.060
Captain, we need to turn back now.

14:30.060 --> 14:32.270
We're going to wait for those kids

14:32.270 --> 14:34.960
so they don't get
lost on the way back.

14:39.610 --> 14:40.770
Not yet!

14:40.770 --> 14:42.310
Our future...

14:42.310 --> 14:44.780
is for us to defend by ourselves!

14:44.780 --> 14:45.950
So...

14:45.950 --> 14:48.120
we're never going to give up!

14:48.120 --> 14:49.780
Pyoro-2!

14:56.590 --> 14:58.330
Damn it...

14:58.330 --> 14:59.990
Please!

15:03.000 --> 15:07.200
Friends. Precious lives.

15:07.200 --> 15:10.070
Friends are to be protected.

15:32.730 --> 15:34.390
W-We did it.

15:45.770 --> 15:47.340
This is...

15:47.340 --> 15:49.000
What?

15:52.150 --> 15:53.480
What happened?

15:53.480 --> 15:55.480
It's the Paksis.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.880
Him...

15:56.880 --> 16:00.150
It's truly one of our friends.

16:00.150 --> 16:01.750
Thank you.

16:04.660 --> 16:05.990
We won...

16:05.990 --> 16:08.830
We were able to protect our future.

16:08.830 --> 16:10.360
Why so somber?

16:10.360 --> 16:13.330
It's not like you.

16:13.330 --> 16:15.370
Snide remarks are all gone.

16:15.370 --> 16:16.940
You won't get it from me.

16:16.940 --> 16:18.040
Ouch!

16:18.040 --> 16:20.070
Why're you still wrapping it, idiot?

16:20.070 --> 16:21.080
Because...

16:21.080 --> 16:22.210
Let's go back.

16:22.210 --> 16:23.780
To our homeland.

16:23.780 --> 16:24.910
Yeah!

16:24.910 --> 16:26.810
Hey, we did it!

16:26.810 --> 16:29.680
- Amazing, amazing, amazing!
- Everyone's all right.

16:29.680 --> 16:30.680
That's right!

16:30.680 --> 16:33.750
We did it, Q!

16:33.750 --> 16:37.660
I'm glad my arms aren't stretched...

16:37.660 --> 16:38.760
Sheesh.

16:38.760 --> 16:40.690
I can't die just yet.

16:40.690 --> 16:44.160
Not until I see what the
future holds for these kids.

16:44.160 --> 16:47.030
I can't leave them alone.
They're too dangerous!

16:47.030 --> 16:48.700
Yes.

16:55.640 --> 16:57.610
They sure showed me something nice.

17:13.330 --> 17:16.300
Captain, how did the talks
with Grand Pa and Grand Ma go?

17:18.900 --> 17:22.770
They said the two planets
will now begin communicating.

17:25.040 --> 17:27.340
As the middle ground between them

17:27.340 --> 17:31.150
this area and the Nirvana
will prove to be of importance.

17:31.150 --> 17:34.720
We'll be the model
case for men and women.

17:34.720 --> 17:35.780
Model case?

17:35.780 --> 17:38.050
Men and women here together?

17:38.050 --> 17:39.950
You guys sure make things hard.

17:39.950 --> 17:43.620
Things between men
and women can't be forced.

17:43.620 --> 17:46.260
The men are to return to Tarak

17:46.260 --> 17:51.700
and select the men who will
live with women experimentally.

17:51.700 --> 17:53.870
- Roger!
- When do we depart?

17:53.870 --> 17:55.640
Now, if possible.

17:55.640 --> 17:57.100
You're kidding!

17:57.100 --> 17:59.370
It's not like you won't see them again.

17:59.370 --> 18:04.240
But I still haven't had
Mr. Alien keep his promise!

18:04.240 --> 18:05.380
Promise?

18:05.380 --> 18:08.820
To go visit Dita's room.

18:08.820 --> 18:12.290
I just thought of so many things.

18:12.290 --> 18:15.020
What things?

18:15.020 --> 18:20.290
Why do pirates have to
be government-sanctioned daycare?

18:27.530 --> 18:28.870
Don't push yourselves.

18:28.870 --> 18:30.540
Take care!

18:30.540 --> 18:32.710
Do your best, guys!

18:32.710 --> 18:34.310
You're coming there.

18:34.310 --> 18:37.580
- Pyoro-2 is...
- Quit whining and get on!

18:37.580 --> 18:38.570
Ow.

18:40.350 --> 18:41.820
Doctor.

18:41.820 --> 18:43.450
Hurry back.

18:43.450 --> 18:45.920
Our patients are rather selfish.

18:45.920 --> 18:47.350
Yes, I'll do that.

18:47.350 --> 18:49.360
Then we'll see you in a while, ribbit!

18:49.360 --> 18:51.590
What is it, Pai?

18:51.590 --> 18:54.080
It's been nagging me forever!

18:58.770 --> 19:02.340
- Satisfied?
- What are they doing?

19:02.340 --> 19:03.500
What is it?

19:03.500 --> 19:05.670
The men you choose...

19:05.670 --> 19:08.440
I'll interview them
all before we decide.

19:08.440 --> 19:11.150
Dirty and ugly guys
are out of the question.

19:11.150 --> 19:14.680
So you have to call
every morning and evening!

19:14.680 --> 19:18.250
You have to every day...

19:18.250 --> 19:21.320
If you forget even once...

19:21.320 --> 19:24.420
I won't forgive you!

19:24.420 --> 19:28.260
Well, she's just looking for
someone to make a baby with.

19:28.260 --> 19:29.430
Come on...

19:29.430 --> 19:31.090
Hibiki.

19:38.310 --> 19:40.410
I'm glad that I met you.

19:40.410 --> 19:41.910
Thank you.

19:41.910 --> 19:43.140
Sure.

19:43.140 --> 19:46.680
Come on, it's not
the time to be acting shy!

19:46.680 --> 19:48.650
But...

19:48.650 --> 19:51.120
Hibiki, she has a favor to ask!

19:51.120 --> 19:52.190
A favor?

19:52.190 --> 19:54.750
Come on, spill it, Dita!

19:55.860 --> 20:01.760
Well, I wanted you to call
me by my name one more time...

20:01.760 --> 20:02.830
Name?

20:02.830 --> 20:06.400
I want to hear it for sure this time.

20:06.400 --> 20:08.070
A-Are you stupid?

20:08.070 --> 20:11.670
I can't call you by
your name for no reason!

20:11.670 --> 20:13.940
It'll be really busy from now on!

20:13.940 --> 20:16.540
So...

20:16.540 --> 20:19.150
Um...

20:19.150 --> 20:21.080
- Geez...
- Hibiki!

20:21.080 --> 20:22.280
What are you doing?

20:22.280 --> 20:23.980
The departure time has passed.

20:23.980 --> 20:25.920
Pyoro-2!

20:25.920 --> 20:30.220
S-So I'll be going now.

20:30.220 --> 20:31.890
See ya...

20:47.940 --> 20:49.600
Dita!

20:52.380 --> 20:54.040
Come on!

20:58.720 --> 20:59.690
Yeah!

20:59.690 --> 21:00.520
For instance,

21:00.520 --> 21:02.790
even if those arms of yours

21:02.790 --> 21:05.630
Become entwined in chains

21:05.630 --> 21:06.530
For instance,

21:06.530 --> 21:09.060
even if this space we live in

21:09.060 --> 21:13.430
Someday will burn completely down

21:13.430 --> 21:19.700
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

21:21.040 --> 21:26.040
Overpassing broken time

21:26.910 --> 21:32.010
if there's a truth of life out there

21:32.990 --> 21:37.980
Keeping unreachable emotions a secret

21:38.990 --> 21:41.360
if you sit embracing your knees,

21:41.360 --> 21:45.030
lonely girl

21:45.030 --> 21:50.840
I'm sure that we'll get there, as well

21:50.840 --> 21:57.180
To that faraway utopia

21:57.180 --> 21:58.110
For instance,

21:58.110 --> 22:00.450
even if those arms of yours

22:00.450 --> 22:03.380
Become entwined in chains

22:03.380 --> 22:04.250
For instance,

22:04.250 --> 22:06.720
even if this space we live in

22:06.720 --> 22:11.090
Someday will burn completely down

22:11.090 --> 22:14.420
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

22:15.400 --> 22:16.260
For instance,

22:16.260 --> 22:18.630
even if sorrow takes you

22:18.630 --> 22:21.470
And you're about to collapse under it

22:21.470 --> 22:22.340
For instance,

22:22.340 --> 22:24.870
if my chest can become

22:24.870 --> 22:29.280
A power to hold you and keep you there

22:29.280 --> 22:30.680
I'm sure that even tomorrow

22:30.680 --> 22:33.700
we can survive.
